  "scope": {
    "inputs": "A1 immutable geometry/query; current configuration; original Binary64/TwoWord and exact material expression at q=2^-2148. No rounded query injection.",
    "outputs": "12 scaled centers and absolute radii, full-width qualification, stable closest entity/far, verified incidence or detached, owned snapshot/query/ambient scatter, limits/work, optional StageTiming, GlobalGeometryNotChecked.",
    "precision": "tau finite/nonnegative; full width2r; exact integer sqrt trials with 256fraction enclosure; common powers2 cancellation changes no trial/equality/output/work.",
    "budgets": "23 fixed integers in planned workspace; checked32768/et_off; scalar comparison <=21000bit; width area RHS<=16904bit. Payload vs external28672byte estimate vs RSS separated; strict proven bound absent =>Unsupported."
  },
  "definition_of_done": [
    "LG-F01〜14を既存A1拒否境界と新packet経路へ接続。exact軸tau0成功と非exact長さtau0拒否、全幅係数4、subgrid残差を固定。",
    "全4query/頂点辺面支持、6頂点置換、quad両子の全LR散布、最近実体/厳密far隣接を検査。",
    "元query/immutable snapshot/context/identity/全ambient順と元語を所有。元入力/両workspace破棄後の消費と移動元拒否を検査。",
    "製品sqrtを共有しないcpp_rational＋integer sqrt256bit囲い。tau1e-10、共変1e-8、分類tol0、thin、2^±900、巨大原点low、word-gapを検査。",
    "content/時刻不一致、payload等号/不足、総work/subcap境界、設定済取消、再入、別workspace並列、実allocation全ordinalのbad_alloc→ResourceExceededとlease解放/旧owner不変を検査。",
    "byte同一controlと6隔離変異をproducer2TU＋test再compileで検出。inline helperの元testobj迂回なし。",
    "影響A1既存2＋新2CTestのclean D/R、対象static/format、日本語とroot数理/型/資源レビュー、工程/bit比較、source/artifact hashを保存。trace/root最終record審査は後続metadata。"
  ],
